Description: Sliding puzzle (15-Puzzle) game for Deepin desktop
 A classic 15-Puzzle sliding tile game built with Qt6 and DTK6,
 featuring smooth tile animations, multiple grid sizes (3x3, 4x4),
 move counting, and full internationalization support.
